":"shape","kind":"rectangle","position":{"x":10720,"y":4770},"width":1720,"height":120,"fillColor":"#607d8b","text":"Facilitation guide","textFontFamily":"Inter","textAlignment":"left","attachedFrame":"PhGcasblOAg0hFYq76JlW","textSize":56,"textColor":"#ffffff","textBold":true},{"id":"SDLFXjs6MhtOksX35yhhf","type":"shape","kind":"rectangle","position":{"x":10740,"y":4940},"width":1680,"height":1060,"fillColor":"transparent","text":"🚀 Timeline: How it works in 4 steps\n\n🎯 Purpose: Arrange events in time, e.g. project history, a reading unit in class or a roadmap.\n\n1. Define the axis (5 min)\nAction: Replace the example years with your time points (years, months, sprints).\n\n2. Collect events (10 min)\nAction: Everyone writes events on cards and places them at the right point.\nRule: Above the axis = plans or milestones, below = actual events (or define your own rule).\n\n3. Connect (10 min)\nAction: Discuss gaps, overlaps and causes. Add missing cards.\n\n4. Conclude (5 min)\nAction: Highlight the 2–3 most important moments and what follows from them.\n\n🛠️ Your role as facilitator\nStructurer: Agree on the above/below rule before starting.\nStoryteller: Summarise the timeline as a short story at the end.","textFontFamily":"Inter","textAlignment":"left","attachedFrame":"PhGcasblOAg0hFYq76JlW","textSize":30,"textColor":"#000000"},{"id":"dQh0JzQavEVHRVsAHGHw_","type":"shape","kind":"rectangle","position":{"x":12640,"y":4770},"width":1920,"height":120,"fillColor":"#ff5722","text":"METADATEN · T10 · wird vor Veröffentlichung entfernt","textFontFamily":"Inter","textAlignment":"left","attachedFrame":"PR0unda5MY844fb1ItZb5","textSize":44,"textColor":"#ffffff","textBold":true},{"id":"BTMntRGDzbArYEBGLghPo","type":"shape","kind":"rectangle","position":{"x":12640,"y":4910},"width":1920,"height":130,"fillColor":"transparent","text":"Template-ID: T10   ·   Datei: T10_timeline.en.nwb   ·   Board-Format: v2 (Infinite Canvas)\nQuelle: Schnellstart_Paket.nwb (= Schnellstart_Templates.nwb) › Rahmen 9\nAusfüllen: In „Ihr Eintrag\" eigenen Text schreiben oder ✓ setzen, um den Vorschlag zu übernehmen. Leer = noch offen.","textFontFamily":"Inter","textAlignment":"left","attachedFrame":"PR0unda5MY844fb1ItZb5","textSize":22,"textColor":"#000000"},{"id":"qDeDPOULYyVWYDM6CeOPx","type":"shape","kind":"rectangle","position":{"x":12640,"y":5060},"width":430,"height":60,"fillColor":"#607d8b","text":"Feld","textFontFamily":"Inter","textAlignment":"left","attachedFrame":"PR0unda5MY844fb1ItZb5","textSize":24,"textColor":"#ffffff","textBold":true},{"id":"7Yz8KqGY6U2FEZbGmqGMc","type":"shape","kind":"rectangle","position":{"x":13090,"y":5060},"width":690,"height":60,"fillColor":"#607d8b","text":"Vorschlag","textFontFamily":"Inter","textAlignment":"left","attachedFrame":"PR0unda5MY844fb1ItZb5","textSize":24,"textColor":"#ffffff","textBold":true},{"id":"P3U7A9Z4NS2h-JoYruIM7","type":"shape","kind":"rectangle","position":{"x":13800,"y":5060},"width":760,"height":60,"fillColor":"#607d8b","text":"Ihr Eintrag","textFontFamily":"Inter","textAlignment":"left","attachedFrame":"PR0unda5MY844fb1ItZb5","textSize":24,"textColor":"#ffffff","textBold":true},{"id":"s8PyGNo5SuT2sgkCa5kEO","type":"shape","kind":"rectangle","position":{"x":12640,"y":5128},"width":430,"height":93,"fillColor":"#d7dee2","text":"Veröffentlichen?\n[publish]","textFontFamily":"Inter","textAlignment":"left","attachedFrame":"PR0unda5MY844fb1ItZb5","textSize":24,"textColor":"#000000"},{"id":"zXnzALmwx2--DeDae-DSy","type":"shape","kind":"rectangle","position":{"x":13090,"y":5128},"width":690,"height":93,"fillColor":"#e6e6e6","text":"ja","textFontFamily":"Inter","textAlignment":"left","attachedFrame":"PR0unda5MY844fb1ItZb5","textSize":24,"textColor":"#000000","textItalic":true},{"id":"i0-drj79fAUGqzmXmeAAp","type":"shape","kind":"rectangle","position":{"x":13800,"y":5128},"width":760,"height":93,"fillColor":"#ffface","text":"","textFontFamily":"Inter","textAlignment":"left","attachedFrame":"PR0unda5MY844